  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a wok over medium-high heat.",
    "Add chicken and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add onion, ginger, and garlic and cook until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add scotch bonnet peppers and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add curry powder and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add coconut milk, rice wine, allspice, thyme, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Stir in the chicken and cook until heated through.",
    "Serve immediately over steamed rice."
